rpsh reimplements PowerShell and follows the structure, behaviour and public
names of the upstream implementation:

  PowerShell — https://github.com/PowerShell/PowerShell
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The files under inventory/, the message catalog under
crates/rpsh-messages/src/, and the files named *.golden under
tests/conformance/ are generated from the latest stable PowerShell release
installed by scripts/fetch-pwsh.sh. The exact version is recorded in the
generated header or in tests/conformance/reference.txt.
bench/assets/compiler.test.ps1 is copied from the upstream test suite.

The ICU tailoring in crates/rpsh-runtime/src/culture/ignore_case.rules is
derived from the width and kana tables in .NET 11.0.0's pal_collation.c:

  .NET Runtime — https://github.com/dotnet/runtime
  Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors.
  Licensed under the MIT License.

